  "question": {
    "text": "Monochromatic radiation of wavelength <math> <mtext>λ</mtext> </math> is incident on a hydrogen sample in ground state. Hydrogen atoms absorb a fraction of light and subsequently emit radiation of six different wavelengths. Find the value of <math> <mtext>λ</mtext></math>.",
